{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-03_beg",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-03",
  "title": "狂奔",
  "storyCode": "1-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a81ce5e415bbcbd0dcfa7628d5fd2d15cbdee973102c1ebee8fd196079b0c018",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第八关（前）\n时间未知 \\ 天气未知 \\ 能见度 低\n切尔诺伯格 行动组E0所在地\nDr.{@nickname}营救行动 第三阶段"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还剩不到一个小时，没时间从其他区域绕行了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们浪费的时间越多，天灾在我们头顶发生的可能性就越大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "必须直接穿过当前区域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以我们现在的规模，团队行动难免会被发觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在狭窄的街巷中行动，很容易被埋伏包夹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "选择不多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，你的想法呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "正面碾压过去就好！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "整合运动的个人实力并不能和我们相提并论。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "大多数情况下，都只是在依赖人海战术围攻我们。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "临光",
              "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "依靠速度，不断前进，尽量减少一次性交战的人数的话——"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......大概，他们也没法阻拦......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "他们并没有构筑防御工事。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "临光",
              "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "如果我们突袭他们的封锁线......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "虽然看上去人数众多，但整合运动这样松散的布置，是拦不住我们的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "敌人想组织反击也需要时间。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "整合运动的通信方式，从过往的战斗来看，是十分原始的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "临光",
              "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "在我们突破敌人的阻碍，当他们开始组织起来，尝试截击我们的时候......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "当整合运动终于集结完毕，我们也早已经到达了下一个区域。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "临光",
              "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "不错。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "临光",
              "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "猛烈冲击，搅乱阵形，破坏火力点，迅速撤退。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "临光",
              "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "......杜宾，你在考验我，还是在考验——"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "肉眼可见的威胁远比进退两难容易处理得多。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我可以把这看作是Dr.{@nickname}的命令吗，阿米娅？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "局势很明了了。我相信博士的选择......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "——所谓信任，也不光是一场战役就能轻松建立的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我很看好Dr.{@nickname}，但阿米娅......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "不要放松警惕。你当然可以借助博士的智慧，但不可以完全依赖他。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "——我知道。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "别介意，博士，我没想刁难你。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "只是，希望你能理解——阿米娅需要更多的学习和成长。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "站在我的立场上，你也不会允许阿米娅太依靠别人的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "不过，我已经认可了你的指挥能力。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "谢谢......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也别那么拘谨，我们可已经是共患难的战友了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少在战场，我的生命，已经交给你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "闲谈到此为止，抓紧时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡西米尔有句谚语：“喘息时，死亡就会追上你。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
